
               DDTop V1.0 For DayDream BBS - Quick documentation
               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

  What it this thing?
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
	Nice top 10 users lister for DayDream BBS.

  Features
  ~~~~~~~~
	- Nice outlook
	- Fast (from harddrive, from diskdrives this is hell :)
	- Generates Top 10 uploaders, Top 10 downloaders, Top 10 Up&Down
	  (combined listing), Top 10 callers, Top 10 Message writers
	  and Top 10 Crap uploaders (requires faker)

  Configuration
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
	DDTop looks it's configfile from the path that is defined
	in ENV:-variable DreamUtils. Configfile is called DDTop.Config and
	it looks like this:

-------------------------------------------------- cut -------------------
H
O
H
DayDream:Bulletins/Bulletin.2
DayDream:Bulletins/Bulletin.3
DayDream:Bulletins/Bulletin.4
DayDream:Bulletins/Bulletin.5
DayDream:Bulletins/Bulletin.6
DayDream:Bulletins/Bulletin.7


LINE 1 : If "H" Use handles, if "N" use real names
LINE 2 : If "O" Use organization, if "L" use location
LINE 3 : If "D" disable headers, if "H" use default headers
LINE 4 : Path to Top 10 uploaders (.TXT / .GFX Added automagically)
LINE 5 : Path to Top 10 leechers (.TXT / .GFX Added automagically)
LINE 6 : Path to Top 10 uploaders & downloaders (.TXT / GFX AA)
LINE 7 : Path to Top 10 Message Writers (.TXT / .GFX Added automagically)
LINE 8 : Path to Top 10 Callers (.TXT / GFX AA)
LINE 9 : Path to Top 10 Junk uploaders (.TXT / GFX AA, Faker required)
-------------------------------------------------- cut -------------------

	Installing this shouldn't cause any problems.

